The .abi files here are the frozen interfaces of the ERC20, ERC721 and ERC1155 pointer
contracts deployed on chain before pointer creation was retired. The CLI, the CosmWasm EVM
bindings and the synthetic CosmWasm receipts use them to encode calls to, and decode events
from, ERC tokens. native/NativeSeiTokensERC20.bin is the deployed native pointer bytecode,
kept so tests can deploy a real native pointer.

Nothing regenerates these files. Their Solidity sources are not in the tree, and a rebuild
could only produce bytecode that differs from what is deployed.
